OL,3,GNEWSAProject offering support to
OL,4,Ateenage fathers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has been supported by an
OL,7,Faward-winning project to help young
OL,8,Fdads has said "I don't know where I'd
OL,9,Fbe without it".
OL,11,FLuke Hills from Swindon was 19 years
OL,12,Fold when he became father to Hudson,
OL,13,Fwho was born at 28 weeks and has
OL,14,Fquadriplegic cerebral palsy.
OL,16,FHe was offered practical and emotional
OL,17,Fsupport by Dads at their Best, a
OL,18,Fproject that specifically works with
OL,19,Fteenage and young fathers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
